        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Then there is the question of "
            },
            {
              "text": "what happens next.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " After the last target, the Posse's work is done. "
            },
            {
              "text": "No more cookies. No more cards. No more screaming, audible or otherwise.",
              "italic": true
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "text": "The Posse will be, as with every great fire, forgotten.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "text": "The flames get the headlines. The ashes get a short paragraph on the back page.",
              "italic": true
